Authors and copyright holders of seams-core and of the chemfiles it builds

seams-core is by the d-SEAMS core team; CITATION.cff names its authors.
License: MIT (LICENSE).

When no installed chemfiles passes cmake/chemfiles_mmcif_probe.cpp, the
build fetches chemfiles 0.10.4, patches it with cmake/patches/, and
installs it as libseams-chemfiles. The parts it compiles are listed below
with their authors; LICENSE.note gives each licence. Paths are inside the
fetched chemfiles source.


1. chemfiles 0.10.4

  Authors: Guillaume Fraux and contributors: Elsa Perrin,
    François-Xavier Coudert, Guillaume Fraux, Jonathan Fine,
    Laura Scalfi, Len Kimms, Maximilien Levesque, Patricio Barletta
    (chemfiles AUTHORS)
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  Source: https://github.com/chemfiles/chemfiles
  Patches in cmake/patches: the d-SEAMS developers

Header-only code in include/chemfiles/external:

optional.hpp
  Authors: Andrzej Krzemienski
  License: BSL-1.0
span.hpp
  Authors: Guillaume Fraux, Martin Moene, Microsoft Corporation
  License: MIT
string_view.hpp
  Authors: Martin Moene
  License: BSL-1.0


